{"base_rate":0.3751651254953765,"brier":0.18645680317040952,"bss":0.2045909790667897,"bss_hi":0.30081724034465723,"bss_lo":0.10534714372445202,"chart":{"base":[548.5,66.5],"fp":[311.1,267.4],"lead":"62,277.8 272,255.2 482,215.3 692,144.1","note":{"base":"skill 0.20 — higher than 28% of cities","fp":"low end +11pp, high end +23pp","lead":"day-1 error 0.9 °C — better than 88% of cities","rel":"promised 1% → rained 11%; promised 100% → rained 80%"},"rel":"66.5,419.5 218.2,335.8 539.5,230.9 690.7,122.1"},"country":"SE","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.1355878467635403,"ess":533.4936355205139,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Linkoeping</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Linkoeping rain forecast is moderately skilful, though 6 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (100%), believe about\n<b>80%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>9%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 757 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-05-31. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nLINKOEPING-MALMSLAETT, 5.3 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.20, ranked 154 of\n213 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(99&ndash;173) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>9%</b></td><td class='num'>223</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>3%</td><td class='num'><b>16%</b></td><td class='num'>74</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>14%</td><td class='num'><b>26%</b></td><td class='num'>78</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>35%</td><td class='num'><b>35%</b></td><td class='num'>78</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>63%</td><td class='num'><b>49%</b></td><td class='num'>76</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>90%</td><td class='num'><b>61%</b></td><td class='num'>71</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>100%</td><td class='num'><b>80%</b></td><td class='num'>157</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">6 of 7 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Linkoeping</b> <span class=\"muted\">Sweden</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Moderately skilful</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">6 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.20</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>99&ndash;173\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 213</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>757 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Linkoeping &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Linkoeping\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"